== Notes ==
* An online run's save file uses the player's who has the least unlocks completed.
** This means that if one player is missing an unlock, then all players will be missing that unlock.
** The {{m|Donation Machine}} uses the amount of that save file.
** Character unlocks, such as {{c|The Lost}}'s {{i|Holy Mantle}}, are determined on a per-player basis. This includes the Holy Mantle from the white fire in {{s|Downpour}} / {{s|Dross}}.
*** Due to a bug(?), {{c|Keeper}}'s 3rd [[Coin Heart]] and starting [[Coins|penny]] are tied to the file used.
* When a player joins a game that is in progress, they join automatically at the start of the next floor.
* Achievements are enabled, unless joining in the middle of a game, where a special icon will tell that achievements are disabled.
* When waiting in a lobby in online mode, text will display stating the current status of the run and the floor that it is on. This feature was present in the beta, but removed in Repentance+'s official release. It was readded in [[V1.9.7.16|v1.9.7.16.J450]]. Texts displayed are:
# '''Fighting [Boss] in [Floor]''': Players are fighting the boss (or boss wave, in Greed mode). Waiting players spawn after end trapdoor entry. In Greed mode, the boss isn't specified, except for Ultra Greed.
# '''Fighting a Miniboss in [Floor]''': Players are fighting a miniboss.
# '''Looking to the stars in [Floor]''': Players have entered a Planetarium.
# '''Collecting treasure in [Floor]''': Players have entered a Treasure Room.
# '''Shopping in [Floor]''': Players have entered a shop.
# '''Shopping the black market in [Floor]''': Players have entered a black market.
# '''Exploring [Floor]:''' Players are in any normal room.
# '''Found a Secret in [Floor]''': Players are exploring one of the various secret rooms.
# '''Praying to the angels/Making a deal with the devil in [Floor]''': Players have entered a devil or angel deal.
# '''CURSED! in [Floor]''': Players have entered a cursed room.
# '''Playing in Isaac's room in [Floor]''': Players have entered a bedroom.
# '''Rummaging below [Floor]''': Players are in a crawlspace.
# '''Looting the chest in [Floor]''': Players have entered a vault.
# '''Browsing a special selection''': Players have entered the underground shop from {{i|Member Card}} (Please verify).
# '''We used to live here...''': Players are in the special version of Home from {{i|Death Certificate}}.
# '''Fighting wave X/10(11) in [Floor]''': Players are on a current wave in Greed (Greedier) mode.
# '''Fighting devil wave in [Floor]''': Players are on the devil wave in Greed mode.
# '''Playing challenge in [Floor]''': Players are participating in a challenge.
* [[Victory Lap]]s don't disable achievements.
* This mode adds a new pause menu only found while playing online.
** Completing a mark in Normal/Greed Mode turns the bloody border around the mark blue, and completing it in Hard Mode/Greedier Mode turns it purple.

