== Trivia ==
* Doors closing behind players was added in a later build of the online beta to prevent people fighting over where to go.
* During early beta testing, options usually available in single player are unavailable when playing online, such as switching modes and entering seeds.
** Prior to the beta’s closure, modes were rotated in each beta. December 2023’s beta was Normal Mode only, January 2024 was Hard Mode only, and February 2024 was Greed Mode.
*** It was technically possible to play in Hard Mode in the December 2023 beta due to [[Victory Lap]]s.
** There was an option to switch modes, however it was unable to be interacted with.

